    "Open a formula, tap Weigh and follow the sheet. When you finish, save it here and Accord reminds you to smell it on day 7, 14 and 28.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open a formula, tap Weigh and follow the sheet. When you finish, save it here and Accord reminds you to smell it on day 7, 14 and 28."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打開一個配方，點「秤量」照著清單秤。完成後存在這裡，Accord 會在第 7、14、28 天提醒你聞聞看。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开一个配方，点“称量”照着清单称。完成后存在这里，Accord 会在第 7、14、28 天提醒你闻闻看。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "処方を開いて「計量」をタップし、シートに沿って量ります。終わったらここに保存すれば、7・14・28 日目に香りを確かめるよう Accord が知らせます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "처방을 열고 '계량'을 눌러 시트대로 재세요. 끝나면 여기에 저장하면 Accord가 7, 14, 28일째에 향을 맡아 보라고 알려 줍니다."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffne ein Rezept, tippe auf Wiegen und folge dem Blatt. Speichere es danach hier, dann erinnert dich Accord an Tag 7, 14 und 28 ans Riechen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrez une formule, touchez Peser et suivez la feuille. À la fin, enregistrez le lot ici et Accord vous rappelle de le sentir aux jours 7, 14 et 28."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abre una fórmula, toca Pesar y sigue la hoja. Al terminar, guárdalo aquí y Accord te recordará olerlo los días 7, 14 y 28."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abra uma fórmula, toque em Pesar e siga a folha. Ao terminar, salve aqui e o Accord lembra você de cheirar nos dias 7, 14 e 28."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apri una formula, tocca Pesa e segui il foglio. Alla fine salvalo qui: Accord ti ricorderà di annusarlo ai giorni 7, 14 e 28."
          }
        }
      }
    },
